| `DECISIONS.md` | dated decisions (`D0XX`), newest first, only added | lessons, the current state |
| `plans/` | approved plans, one file each (`YYYY-MM-DD_<subject>.md`), with a checkbox and the evidence of every step | lessons and decisions (they go to the logs above) |
