<!-- ems:protocol -->
## Project memory

- At the start of every session read this file and `MEMORY.md`. Read `DECISIONS.md` only to record a decision or to find out why something is the way it is.
- When the user corrects you, a choice between alternatives is made, or you find something non-obvious: follow **record** in `.agents/skills/project-memory/SKILL.md` (write directly, then report in one line).
- Before reporting any task as done: follow **close** in the same skill.
- When this file passes 150 lines, `memory.py check` fails: move what is not needed in every session to a referenced file that is read only when it applies.
<!-- /ems:protocol -->
